                    {
                      "code": "\n\tif value is None: return []\n\tassets \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetToJSON(system.kanoa.asset.getAssets({\u0027assetPath\u0027: value + \u0027%\u0027, \u0027assetTypeName\u0027: \u0027Line\u0027}))\n\n\treturn [{\u0027value\u0027: item[\u0027assetPath\u0027], \u0027label\u0027: system.kanoa.utilities.formatPath(item[\u0027assetPath\u0027], {\u0027drop\u0027: value})} for item in assets]",
